Revenue allocated to remaining performance obligations that are unsatisfied or partially unsatisfied include amounts received from customers and amounts that will be invoiced and recognized as revenue in future periods for development and engineering services, IP licensing, and product revenue. As of March 28, 2026, the aggregate transaction price allocated to remaining performance obligations under contracts with an original expected duration of more than one year¬†was $
264
 million, of which $
167
 million is expected to be recognized in the next 
12
