Operating Segments Trends and Results
Intel Products
Intel Products consists substantially of the design, development, marketing, sale, support, and servicing of CPUs and related solutions for third-party customers. The manufacturing of our Intel Products offerings is performed by Intel Foundry and, to a lesser extent, certain third party manufacturers. Intel Products is comprised of two operating segments: CCG and DCAI. CCG delivers platforms and processors that power personal computers, enabling enhanced performance, connectivity and user experiences. DCAI provides high-performance computing, AI acceleration, and infrastructure solutions, supporting data centers, cloud providers, and enterprises in meeting the growing demand for data processing and AI workloads. Intel Products Financial Performance
