in Q3 2025 includes charges of $146 million primarily relating to the 2025 Restructuring Plan. In YTD 2025, we incurred charges of $1.8 billion primarily relating to the 2025 Restructuring Plan. Charges of $2.2 billion in Q3 2024 and $2.5 billion in YTD 2024 were primarily related to the 2024 Restructuring Plan. Litigation charges and other 
