The valuation techniques used to measure the fair values of the Company‚Äôs Level 2 financial instruments, which generally have counterparties with high credit ratings, are based on quoted market prices or model-driven valuations using significant inputs derived from or corroborated by observable market data. As of March¬†28, 2026, 
79
