In December 2025, the FASB issued ASU No. 2025-10, Government Grants (Topic 832): Accounting for Government Grants Received by Business Entities. The ASU establishes authoritative guidance in GAAP about accounting for government grants received by business entities, clarifies the appropriate accounting, in an effort to reduce diversity in practice, and increase consistency of application across business entities. The ASU is effective for annual reporting periods beginning after December 15, 2028, and interim reporting periods within those annual reporting periods.™N␀␀␀␀␀ÜT␀␀␀␀␀bZ␀␀␀␀␀>`␀␀␀␀␀f␀␀␀␀␀ˆk␀␀␀␀␀“q␀␀␀␀␀Æw␀␀␀␀␀ä}␀␀␀␀␀fÉ␀␀␀␀␀Bâ␀␀␀␀␀è␀␀␀␀␀…ê␀␀␀␀␀Œê␀␀␀␀␀í␀␀␀␀␀ì␀␀␀␀␀®ò␀␀␀␀␀nõ␀␀␀␀␀/°␀␀␀␀␀…¶␀␀␀␀␀í´␀␀␀␀␀O≠␀␀␀␀␀Ü≤␀␀␀␀␀mµ␀␀␀␀␀ª␀␀␀␀␀kª␀␀␀␀␀¡␀␀␀␀␀”∆␀␀␀␀␀K…␀␀␀␀␀›Õ␀␀␀␀␀m”␀␀␀␀␀D◊␀␀␀␀␀
